    "summary": "[Untrammelled Ferocity](vsdata:ability/tyranids.crusher-stampede.untrammelled-ferocity) applies on a [Fall Back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back), an [Advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move). The unit can cross sections of terrain up to 4″ tall and can pass within enemy [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range). It must finish clear of enemy Engagement Range. Crossing a terrain section taller than 4″ calls for a D6 after moving. A 1 makes the unit [Battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock).",
